### INTERVIEWS

### Get all interviews
GET http://localhost:8080/api/interviews

### Get interview by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/interviews/6ab3e572a6c146c62293f410

### Get interview with invalid id (expect 400 "Invalid interview ID")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/interviews/123

### Get interview that does not exist (expect 404 "Interview not found")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/interviews/65f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0ff

### Create interview
POST http://localhost:8080/api/interviews HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "userId": "65f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1",
  "applicationId": "6ab3e572a6c146c62293f403",
  "interviewDate": "2026-11-10",
  "interviewType": "Final",
  "interviewer": "David Okafor",
  "location": "Lagos, Nigeria",
  "status": "Cancelled",
  "notes": "Position filled internally before final round."
}

### Create interview missing required fields (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/interviews HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "interviewer": "Jane Smith",
  "location": "Online"
}

